TVLWeightedContainers::activateContainer()
├── given invalid inputs
│   ├── when container is already active
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when container ID does not exist
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when MAX_ACTIVE_CONTAINERS limit is reached
│       └── it should revert
└── given valid inputs
    ├── when activating a single container
    │   ├── it should set container isActive to true
    │   ├── it should add container to activeContainerIds array
    │   └── it should emit ContainerActivated event
    ├── when activating multiple containers
    │   ├── it should set all containers isActive to true
    │   ├── it should add all containers to activeContainerIds array
    │   └── it should maintain correct active container count
    └── when activating after deactivation
        ├── it should allow reactivation
        ├── it should set container isActive to true again
        ├── it should add container back to activeContainerIds array
        └── it should emit ContainerActivated event 